# Files NOT uploaded to Vercel. Syntax is .gitignore's.
#
# READ THIS BEFORE TRIMMING IT. A `vercel` CLI deploy uploads the working
# directory, not a git tree — so .gitignore is NOT what protects a CLI deploy,
# this file is. Anything heavy or private that is gitignored but still sitting
# on disk has to be repeated here or it goes up. That is why the list below
# overlaps .gitignore instead of deferring to it.

# ---- the reason this file exists at all -------------------------------------
# 689 MB of donor and source material, and it lives INSIDE public/, so anything
# that uploads it also SERVES it. volvo_s90_recharge_free.glb alone is 368 MB
# and is CC-BY licensed material we cut the shipped assets from — the built
# 5.4 MB interior is what ships, never the donor. Gitignored, so a git-triggered
# deploy never sees it; this line is what stops a CLI deploy from publishing it.
public/assets-staging/

# ---- the development render archive -----------------------------------------
# docs/gallery/ is a 2.9 MB archive of the A/B comparisons, clay passes and hole
# hunts the interior and sky work was judged on, plus one self-contained
# index.html that reads them. Meant to be browsed on GitHub or opened from a
# clone over file://; it has nothing to do with the running game.
#
# It is already unreachable at runtime three times over — outside public/, so
# Next never serves it; not imported by app/, components/ or game/, so it cannot
# enter the client bundle; and test/size-budget.mjs walks only public/assets and
# public/models, so it cannot push the asset budget over. This is the belt to
# those braces: it also keeps the archive out of the upload, so the images are
# not billed as bandwidth and cannot be fetched from the deployed domain.
#
# If a gallery image ever needs to be visible to the running game, it belongs in
# public/ and under the size budget — not here with an exception carved out.
docs/gallery/

# ---- agent worktrees --------------------------------------------------------
# 1.6 GB of checked-out git worktrees from parallel agent lanes. Gitignored, and
# for the same reason as assets-staging that is not enough on its own here.
.claude/worktrees/

# ---- build output and test junk ---------------------------------------------
# node_modules and .next are excluded by Vercel's own defaults; listed anyway so
# this file reads as the whole picture rather than half of it.
node_modules/
.next/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo
test/artifacts/
.DS_Store
